WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.577
TOM HIDDLESTON
My new series, Loki, is coming soon

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:06.087
to Disney+. And to help
get you ready, I'm going to catch you up

00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:08.816
in just 30 seconds.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.151
My dad, Odin, says
my brother, Thor, can be king.

00:00:11.151 --> 00:00:14.159
I'm jealous, plus he's not my real Dad,
so I get my real dad to kill Odin,

00:00:14.159 --> 00:00:16.531
but then I save him.
Thor's mad anyway, and we fight.

00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:18.841
Cut to Earth:
I steal the Tesseract from S.H.I.E.L.D.,

00:00:18.841 --> 00:00:21.722
help the Chitauri invade Earth, 
the Avengers stop them, and I go to jail

00:00:21.722 --> 00:00:24.658
until Thor needs me to help defeat
the Dark Elves. Next thing you know,

00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:28.563
I'm king, but everyone thinks I'm Odin.
Our sister Hela shows up, cue another

00:00:28.563 --> 00:00:32.695
Thor and Loki team-up, we beat her,
then Thanos shows up, we don't beat him,

00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:34.647
and I die.
Thanos kills half the universe,

00:00:34.647 --> 00:00:37.227
the Avengers go back in time to stop him,
giving an earlier version of me

00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:40.123
a chance to grab the Tesseract...
Oh, hang on!

00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:43.113
Okay, that's better.

00:00:43.113 --> 00:00:45.050
Thanos gets defeated,
and next thing you know,

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:50.342
I've got a job offer from some group
that calls itself the TVA. And that's it!

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:55.938
Find out what happens next
by streaming Loki, exclusively on Disney+.

